### Hent alle personer fra PostgreSQL
GET https://localhost:7011/api/person
Accept: application/json

### Opret person i PostgreSQL
POST https://localhost:7011/api/person
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Person",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "address": "Testvej 10",
  "phone": "12345678"
}

### Hent en bestemt person fra PostgreSQL
GET https://localhost:7011/api/person/01994c90-0423-4dab-aaaf-f0f3900c6eb2
Accept: application/json

### Opdater eksisterende person
PUT https://localhost:7011/api/person/01994c90-0423-4dab-aaaf-f0f3900c6eb2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "3c2ac0ac-9f8c-4aea-948b-27f97b2d91e1",
  "name": "Opdateret Test Person",
  "email": "opdateret@example.com",
  "address": "Ny Testvej 20",
  "phone": "87654321"
}

### Hent den opdaterede person
GET https://localhost:7011/api/person/01994c90-0423-4dab-aaaf-f0f3900c6eb2
Accept: application/json

### Slet en person fra PostgreSQL
DELETE https://localhost:7011/api/person/01994c90-0423-4dab-aaaf-f0f3900c6eb2

### Kontrollér at personen er slettet
GET https://localhost:7011/api/person/01994c90-0423-4dab-aaaf-f0f3900c6eb2
Accept: application/json

### Hent alle lokaler fra PostgreSQL
GET https://localhost:7011/api/room
Accept: application/json

### Opret et lokale
POST https://localhost:7011/api/room
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fælleslokale",
  "location": "Stueetagen"
}

### Hent et bestemt lokale ud fra ID
GET https://localhost:7011/api/room/39ee0117-ca11-48b8-b038-25ee78d0a89b
Accept: application/json

### Opdater et eksisterende lokale
PUT https://localhost:7011/api/room/39ee0117-ca11-48b8-b038-25ee78d0a89b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stort fælleslokale",
  "location": "1. sal"
}

### Slet et lokale
DELETE https://localhost:7011/api/room/39ee0117-ca11-48b8-b038-25ee78d0a89b

### 1. Hent alt ekstraudstyr
GET https://localhost:7011/api/extraequipment
Accept: application/json


### 2. Opret ekstraudstyr
POST https://localhost:7011/api/extraequipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Projektor",
  "location": "Depot"
}


### 3. Hent ekstraudstyr via ID
# Erstat GUID med ID fra POST-svaret
GET https://localhost:7011/api/extraequipment/63a59ffd-a444-4e3f-a27d-80a07f88c371
Accept: application/json


### 4. Opdater ekstraudstyr
# Erstat GUID med ID fra POST-svaret
PUT https://localhost:7011/api/extraequipment/63a59ffd-a444-4e3f-a27d-80a07f88c371
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "4K Projektor",
  "location": "Fælleslokale"
}


### 5. Slet ekstraudstyr
# Erstat GUID med ID fra POST-svaret
DELETE https://localhost:7011/api/extraequipment/63a59ffd-a444-4e3f-a27d-80a07f88c371